spot_hash_verification=every stored/expanded SHA-256 and CRC32 in the census was re-verified from the extracted bytes by the independent census script (run pair byte-identical); whole-package SHA-256 and MD5 recomputed on disk

[validation]
strict_validation=extraction run pair byte-identical; independent census run pair byte-identical; catalog cross-check exact on every field; whole-package SHA-256/MD5 recomputed on disk
fixture_validation=see the E-ROS-0001 ledger entry for the final fixture validation
volatile_artifacts=/tmp/rostock-intake/ (census.json, census.py, census1.txt=census2.txt, extract/, extract-run1.json=extract-run2.json, lane-refusal.txt); all outside every repository tree

[limitations]
no_firmware_bytes=only sizes, offsets, hashes, CRCs and derived boundaries are recorded; no firmware or resource bytes enter Git
roles_not_asserted=component roles are not claimed; the extraction tool labels type numbers only
no_inheritance=no family inheritance is inferred from the shared Apollo4-class SP 0x1005ffc0, the identical type-1 v1 header hash, or the Sapporo-class layout; the device README forbids it
runtime_placement_unproven=the load fields overlap and no runtime placement, memory map or IRQ contract is derived from the package
lane_fields_missing=memory map, IRQ contract, board wiring, first bounded stop, display contract and input contract have no Rostock evidence; the lane CLI refuses
eligibility=ineligible for an executable profile today under the ticket-770 frozen interfaces; the audit-note blocker (no extraction) is stale, but 775 may not start on this dispatch alone
